From reitter-8DAjSxpRXgY at public.gmane.org  Tue Feb 16 13:00:44 2016
From: reitter-8DAjSxpRXgY at public.gmane.org (David Reitter)
Date: Tue, 16 Feb 2016 08:00:44 -0500
Subject: Re: Can one skip steps in model comparison?
In-Reply-To: <000001d16891$9d72ad20$d8580760$@um.edu.mt>
References: <000001d16891$9d72ad20$d8580760$@um.edu.mt>
